{"annotations": [], "blocks": [{"bbox": [92.33333333333334, 63.66666666666663, 171.0, 81.66666666666663], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 1, "seq": 0, "source": "docling", "text": "Oral Health"}, {"bbox": [48.0, 170.0, 97.33333333333334, 180.0], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 1, "seq": 1, "source": "docling", "text": "OPEN ACCESS"}, {"bbox": [49.6063, 188.558, 131.05468693673996, 211.97062800000003], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 1, "seq": 2, "source": "docling", "text": "EDITED BY Nimet Ünlü, Selcuk University, Türkiye"}, {"bbox": [49.6063, 221.26999999999998, 145.38462569821996, 262.7101080000001], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 1, "seq": 3, "source": "docling", "text": "REVIEWED BY Cristian Bersezio, University of Chile, Chile Camilla Vieira Esteves, University of São Paulo, Brazil"}, {"bbox": [49.6063, 269.9401742, 135.14081040000002, 295.53595800000005], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 1, "seq": 4, "source": "docling", "text": "* CORRESPONDENCE Wei Yin yinwei1980@scu.edu.cn"}, {"bbox": [49.6063, 299.64817419999997, 135.71022936085998, 330.345958], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 1, "seq": 5, "source": "docling", "text": "RECEIVED 22 October 2025 REVISED 22 March 2026 ACCEPTED 24 March 2026 PUBLISHED 14 April 2026"}, {"bbox": [49.6063, 339.702, 76.87211110000001, 344.79838461538463], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 1, "seq": 6, "source": "docling", "text": "CITATION"}, {"bbox": [49.6063, 346.59017420000004, 181.46221648045997, 408.127958], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 1, "seq": 7, "source": "docling", "text": "Wang Y, Fu D, Yao L, Zhong Y, Zou L, He J and Yin W (2026) Efficacy and safety of low-concentration whitestrips for extrinsic tooth discoloration: a randomized controlled trial. Front. Oral Health 7:1729993. doi: 10.3389/froh.2026.1729993"}, {"bbox": [49.6063, 417.484, 83.0848, 422.5803846153846], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 1, "seq": 8, "source": "docling", "text": "COPYRIGHT"}, {"bbox": [49.6062, 424.3731742, 181.50283221711993, 548.952608], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 1, "seq": 9, "source": "docling", "text": "© 2026 Wang, Fu, Yao, Zhong, Zou, He and Yin. This is an open-access article distributed under the terms of the Creative Commons Attribution License (CC BY). The use, distribution or reproduction in other forums is permitted, provided the original author(s) and the copyright owner(s) are credited and that the original publication in this journal is cited, in accordance with accepted academic practice. No use, distribution or reproduction is permitted which does not comply with these terms."}, {"bbox": [219.685, 132.85507440000003, 526.266770949853, 224.88707899999997], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 1, "seq": 10, "source": "docling", "text": "Efficacy and safety of lowconcentration whitestrips for extrinsic tooth discoloration: a randomized controlled trial"}, {"bbox": [219.685, 244.21292559999995, 547.9806502787801, 269.673821], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 1, "seq": 11, "source": "docling", "text": "Yuwei Wang, Di Fu, Lin Yao, Yisi Zhong, Ling Zou, Jing He and Wei Yin*"}, {"bbox": [219.685, 277.48117419999994, 547.44691180638, 294.06162800000004], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 1, "seq": 12, "source": "docling", "text": "State Key Laboratory of Oral Diseases & National Center for Stomatology & National Clinical Research Center for Oral Diseases & West China Hospital of Stomatology, Sichuan University, Chengdu, China"}, {"bbox": [219.685, 314.57399999999996, 548.0283477999998, 348.2835], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 1, "seq": 13, "source": "docling", "text": "Objectives: This study aimed to evaluate the effectiveness of Lowconcentration Whitestrips with 3%  hydrogen peroxide (HP) on extrinsic discoloration of incisors, and to evaluate the safety of whitening process."}, {"bbox": [219.685, 350.517, 548.0218458999997, 456.2825999999999], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 1, "seq": 14, "source": "docling", "text": "Methods: Enrolled  adults  with  extrinsic  discolored  incisors  (Vita  shade  guide value >1M1.5) were randomized into treatment and control groups. Treatment group  used  Low-concentration  Whitestrips,  control  group  used  placebo. Tooth color was assessed at baseline and follow-up visits at Day 1, Day 3 and Day 14. Tooth color was assessed by digital shade meter (primary outcomes), and VITA 3D-Master shade guide (secondary outcomes), respectively. Adverse events  (AEs)  and  serious  adverse  events  (SAEs)  including  oral  and  systemic symptoms  based  on  clinical  examination  and  participants'  description  were also recorded."}, {"bbox": [219.685, 458.517, 548.0213064, 552.2641999999998], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 1, "seq": 15, "source": "docling", "text": "Results: 70 adults participated. The primary and secondary outcomes objectively and  subjectively  demonstrated  that  the  treatment  group  exhibited better  whitening  effects  than  the  control.  Additionally,  the  treatment  group was  observed  to  attain  better  effects  with  prolonged  use,  with  W*  values based  on  digital  shade  meter  increasing  from  72.86  to  78.73,  and  the  VITA 3D-Master shade guide color values decreasing from 14.91 to 11.23 ( P < 0.05). Five AEs occurred with no significant difference between groups ( P > 0.05). No SAEs were reported."}, {"bbox": [219.685, 554.5550000000001, 548.0271370999997, 588.2653], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 1, "seq": 16, "source": "docling", "text": "Conclusions: From both objective and subjective perspectives, Lowconcentration Whitestrips were found to be effective in extrinsic discoloration tooth bleaching and were well-tolerated by participants."}, {"bbox": [219.685, 602.517, 547.9989376999999, 636.284], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 1, "seq": 17, "source": "docling", "text": "Clinical  Trial  Registration: Chinese Clinical  Trial  Registry:  https://www.chictr. org.cn/ (ChiCTR2300073971) and National Health Information Platform: http://114.255.48.20/login (MR-51-23-033324)."}, {"bbox": [219.685, 654.404, 250.265, 659.5003846153846], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 1, "seq": 18, "source": "docling", "text": "KEYWORDS"}, {"bbox": [219.685, 664.6180721999999, 547.51349489259, 683.0293026153846], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 1, "seq": 19, "source": "docling", "text": "hydrogen  peroxide, randomized  controlled  trial, safety, tooth whitening, tooth discoloration"}, {"bbox": [219.685, 705.818, 298.26438924999997, 718.697], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 1, "seq": 20, "source": "docling", "text": "Introduction"}, {"bbox": [219.6846, 733.492, 547.6510152, 778.2130999999999], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 1, "seq": 21, "source": "docling", "text": "Extrinsic tooth discoloration refers to the phenomenon where teeth exhibit a change in coloration due to  the  external  accumulation  of  pigments  from substances  such as  food, beverages, and tobacco on the enamel's surface or within its composition (1). As people's demand for an aesthetically pleasing smile has increased, there has been a sharp rise in"}], "checksum": "05ee8ab76a0f1e90d4c40d76519d95dfc27111f1141e306ef2ce837c00dd28ac", "content_present": true, "doc_id": "d-ffae5e192586c330", "docling_version": "2.118.0", "engine_version": "2.118.0", "errors": [], "images": [{"bbox": [48.48848511701559, 47.968312229248795, 167.49335760846733, 78.57575620814487], "blob": "", "caption": "", "checksum": "d6c859b4e6727c9482167f1bff48e36b22b0bb6375eb31228c65d82e16952d18", "mime": "image/png", "page": 1, "storage_ref": ""}, {"bbox": [48.889831295861484, 133.1465612888544, 125.85066030395508, 148.4981018908503], "blob": "", "caption": "", "checksum": "64c425a62b80d9807eb6ec66d8a367b4e2f0de8083148bd3a7db0ba1c3444a6e", "mime": "image/png", "page": 1, "storage_ref": ""}], "page_index": 0, "page_sizes": {"1": [595.280029296875, 841.8900146484375]}, "route": "docling", "schema_version": "v0.1.0", "source_hash": "ffae5e192586c330b0f1ca378793890d7f63ed378c5e49098e39ab7cfeaeccc9", "status": "ok", "tables": [], "timings": {}}